# No em dashes

Never use em dashes (Unicode U+2014) in this project.

Applies to all writing: user-facing copy, comments, docs, commit messages, rules, and assistant responses about this repo.

Use one of these instead:

- A comma: `SkillTape, a study app`
- A colon: `One desktop app: no Docker required`
- A pipe: `SkillTape | Download`
- A period and new sentence
- A regular hyphen with spaces only when a compound modifier needs it: `fill-in-the-blank`

Do not substitute an en dash (Unicode U+2013) when an em dash would have been used.
